[10.093, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;38;2;52;211;153m1. Edit your app\u001b[0m\r\n/Users/you/Documents/wendy-robot-tour/apps/patrol/patrol.py\r\nIn DEFAULT_WAYPOINTS, try changing (1.0, 1.0) to (1.5, 1.0). Each pair is forward and left, in metres.\r\nOpen this file in your editor. Save your changes, then choose Deploy here.\r\n"]
